{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-mat-4-1","title":"Matthew 4:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ, fasting forty days, is tempted of the devil and ministered unto by angels. 12 He dwells in Capernaum; 17 begins to preach; 18 calls Peter and Andrew, 21 James and John; 23 teaches and heals all the diseased.</p>\n<p>was. Mr 1:12,13-15; Lu 4:1-13; Ro 8:14 of the spirit. 1Ki 18:12; 2Ki 2:16; Eze 3:12,14; 8:3; 11:1,24; 40:2; 43:5; Ac 8:39 to. Ge 3:15; Joh 14:30; Heb 2:18; 4:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-2","title":"Matthew 4:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>fasted. Ex 24:18; 34:28; De 9:9,18,25; 18:18; 1Ki 19:8; Lu 4:2 he was. 21:18; Mr 11:12; Joh 4:6; Heb 2:14-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-3","title":"Matthew 4:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the tempter. Job 1:9-12; 2:4-7; Lu 22:31,32; 1Th 3:5; Re 2:10; 12:9-11 if. 3:17; Lu 4:3,9 command. Ge 3:1-5; 25:29-34; Ex 16:3; Nu 11:4-6; Ps 78:17-20; Heb 12:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-4","title":"Matthew 4:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>It is. 7,10; Lu 4:4,8,12; Ro 15:4; Eph 6:17 Man. De 8:3; Lu 4:4 but. 14:16-21; Ex 16:8,15,35; 23:15; 1Ki 17:12-16; 2Ki 4:42-44; 7:1,2 Hag 2:16-19; Mal 3:9-11; Mr 6:38-44; 8:4-9; Joh 6:5-15; 31-59,63 but.That is, as Dr. Campbell renders, \"by every thing which God is pleased to appoint;\" for [rhema ,] which generally signifies a word, is, by a Hebraism, here taken for a thing, like {davar,} in Hebrew.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-5","title":"Matthew 4:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>taketh. Lu 4:9; Joh 19:11 the holy. 27:53; Ne 11:1; Isa 48:2; 52:1; Da 9:16; Re 11:2 on. 2Ch 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-6","title":"Matthew 4:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>for. 4; 2Co 11:14 He shall. Ps 91:11,12; Lu 4:9-12; Heb 1:14 test. Job 1:10; 5:23; Ps 34:7,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-7","title":"Matthew 4:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>It. 4,10; 21:16,42; 22:31,32; Isa 8:20 Thou. Ex 17:2,7; Nu 14:22; De 6:16; Ps 78:18,41,56; 95:9; 106:14; Mal 3:15 Ac 5:9; 1Co 10:9; Heb 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-8","title":"Matthew 4:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>the devil. 5; Lu 4:5-7 and sheweth. 16:26; Es 1:4; 5:11; Ps 49:16,17; Da 4:30; Heb 11:24-26; 1Pe 1:24 1Jo 2:15,16; Re 11:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-9","title":"Matthew 4:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>All. 26:15; Joh 13:3 I give. 1Sa 2:7,8; Ps 72:11; 113:7,8; Pr 8:15; Jer 27:5,6; Da 2:37,38; 4:32 Da 5:18,19,26-28; Joh 12:31; 14:30; 16:11; Re 19:16 if. 1Co 10:20,21; 2Co 4:4; 1Ti 3:6; Re 19:10; 22:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-10","title":"Matthew 4:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Get. 16:23; Jas 4:7; 1Pe 5:9 Satan. 1Ch 21:1; Job 1:6,12; 2:1; Ps 109:6; Zec 3:1,2 Thou shalt. De 6:13,14; 10:20; Jos 24:14; 1Sa 7:3; Lu 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-11","title":"Matthew 4:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the devil. Lu 4:13; 22:53; Joh 14:30 behold. 6; 26:53; 28:2-5; Mr 1:13; Lu 22:43; 1Ti 3:16; Heb 1:6,14 Re 5:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-12","title":"Matthew 4:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>when. Mr 1:14; 6:17; Lu 3:20; 4:14,31; Joh 4:43,54 cast. or, delivered up.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-13","title":"Matthew 4:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>leaving. Lu 4:30,31 Capernaum. 11:23; 17:24; Mr 1:21; Joh 4:46; 6:17,24,59 Zabulon. Jos 19:10-16 Zebulun. Nephthalim. Jos 19:32-39 Naphtali.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-14","title":"Matthew 4:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>it. 1:22; 2:15,23; 8:17; 12:17-21; 26:54,56; Lu 22:37; 24:44; Joh 15:25 Joh 19:28,36,37 saying. Isa 9:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-15","title":"Matthew 4:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Galilee. Jos 20:7; 21:32; 1Ki 9:11; 2Ki 15:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-16","title":"Matthew 4:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>which sat in darkness. Ps 107:10-14; Isa 42:6,7; 60:1-3; Mic 7:8; Lu 1:78,79; 2:32 shadow. Job 3:5; 10:22; 34:22; Ps 44:19; Jer 13:16; Am 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-17","title":"Matthew 4:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>that. Mr 1:14 Repent. 3:2; 9:13; 10:7; Mr 1:15; Lu 5:32; 9:2; 10:11-14; 15:7,10; 24:47 Ac 2:38; 3:19; 11:18; 17:30; 20:21; 26:20; 2Ti 2:25,26; Heb 6:1 kingdom. 11:12; 13:9,11,24,47; 25:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-18","title":"Matthew 4:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>walking. 1:16-18; Lu 5:2 sea. 15:29; Nu 34:11; De 3:17 Chinnereth. Lu 5:1 lake of Gennesaret. Joh 6:1; 21:1 sea of Tiberias. two. 10:2; Lu 6:14; Joh 1:40-42; 6:8 for. Ex 3:1,10; Jud 6:11,12; 1Ki 19:19-21; Ps 78:70-72; Am 7:14,15 1Co 1:27-29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-19","title":"Matthew 4:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Follow. 8:22; 9:9; 16:24; 19:21; Mr 2:14; Lu 5:27; 9:59; Joh 1:43; 12:26 Joh 21:22 I will. Eze 47:9,10; Mr 1:17,18; Lu 5:10,11; 1Co 9:20-22; 2Co 12:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-20","title":"Matthew 4:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>10:37; 19:27; 1Ki 19:21; Ps 119:60; Mr 10:28-31; Lu 18:28-30 Ga 1:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-21","title":"Matthew 4:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>other. 10:2; 17:1; 20:20,21; 26:37; Mr 1:19,20; 3:17; 5:37; Lu 5:10,11 Joh 21:2; Ac 12:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-22","title":"Matthew 4:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>10:37; De 33:9,10; Mr 1:20; Lu 9:59,60; 14:26,33; 2Co 5:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-23","title":"Matthew 4:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Jesus. 9:35; Mr 6:6; Joh 7:1; Ac 10:38 teaching. 12:9; 13:54; Ps 74:8; Mr 1:21,39; 6:2; Lu 4:15,16,44; 13:10 Ac 9:20,13,14-43; 18:4 the gospel. 13:19; 24:14; Mr 1:14; Lu 4:17,18; 8:1; 20:1; Ro 10:15 healing. 8:16,17; 10:7,8; 11:5; 15:30,31; Ps 103:3; Mr 1:32-34; 3:10 Lu 4:40,41; 5:17; 6:17; 7:22; 9:11; 10:9; Ac 5:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-24","title":"Matthew 4:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>his fame. 9:26,31; 14:1; Jos 6:27; 1Ki 4:31; 10:1; 1Ch 14:17; Mr 1:28 Lu 4:14; 5:15 Syria. 2Sa 8:6; Lu 2:2; Ac 15:23,41 all sick. 23; 8:14,15; 9:35; Ex 15:26 possessed. 9:32; 12:22; 15:22; 17:18; Mr 5:2-18; Lu 4:33-35; 8:27-37; Ac 10:38 lunatic. 17:15 those that. 8:6,13; 9:2-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-4-25","title":"Matthew 4:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>followed. 5:1; 8:1; 12:15; 19:2; Mr 3:7; 6:2; Lu 6:17,19 Decapolis. Mr 5:20; 7:31</p>"}]}